---
/* Reading progress: a thin brand bar under the header that fills as the page is read. Decorative, so hidden from
   assistive technology. It stays empty (invisible) under reduced motion and in browsers without scroll timelines.
   Markup matches the legacy article pages; the fill rule is in site.css ([data-progress]). */
---
<div aria-hidden="true" style="position: fixed; inset-block-start: var(--header-height); inset-inline: 0; block-size: var(--space-1); z-index: var(--z-sticky); pointer-events: none;"><div data-progress style="inline-size: 100%; block-size: 100%; background: var(--gradient-brand); transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: var(--origin-inline-start) center;"></div></div>
